 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sharing responsibilities",
     "texto": [
      "**Omsorg** is care or attention. **Foreldrepermisjon** is parental leave after the birth or adoption of a child. In Norwegian, **forelder** is a parent and **foreldre** means parents."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "After a subordinate clause",
     "texto": [
      "If a clause starting with **etter at** («after») comes first, the main clause reverses subject and verb: **Etter at jeg leverer barna, går jeg på jobb** («After I drop the children off, I go to work»). English has no such inversion either."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
